(7751532, 1280839, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GinaRothfels:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Didn''t we just see this in an outtake thread? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I confess you did. At the time I wasn''t planning to enter this but I couldn''t find anything else I was happy with for this challenge. I''ll be more careful next time. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No worries.  We see plenty of back-to-back entries / outtakes, etc.  For example, roz with the double Blue adventure.  :-)  I''ve done it too (I think).  :-P</td>', 'Originally posted by GinaRothfels: Originally posted by glad2badad: Didn''t we just see this in an outtake thread?  I confess you did. At the time I wasn''t planning to enter this but I couldn''t find anything else I was happy with for this challenge. I''ll be more careful next time.  No worries.  We see plenty of back-to-back entries / outtakes, etc.  For example, roz with the double Blue adventure.  :-)  I''ve done it too (I think).  :-P', '2023-06-22 14:02:36.000000', NULL, 0),
